    "helpClose": "Close",
    "helpBack": "Back",
    "helpHtml": "<h3>🎯 Battlefield Goal</h3>\n        <p>This is not just shortest-path. On an <strong>8×8 node grid</strong>, connect the access point to the data core while turning remaining time, integrity, and combo into a high-grade breach.</p>\n        <h3>⚔️ Match Rhythm</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>Read:</strong> Scan ICE patrols, locks, and firewalls before your first segment</li>\n          <li><strong>Push:</strong> ICE moves every step; safe combos beat greedy shortcuts</li>\n          <li><strong>Correct:</strong> Limited undos save one mis-timed patrol crossing</li>\n          <li><strong>Finish:</strong> Near the core, protect integrity — do not hard-crash ICE on the last cells</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>🧩 Node Read</h3>\n        <div class=\"legend\">\n          <span style=\"color:#34d399\">● Access point</span>\n          <span style=\"color:#22d3ee\">◆ Data core</span>\n          <span style=\"color:#ef4444\">▲ ICE</span>\n          <span style=\"color:#6b7280\">■ Locked node</span>\n          <span style=\"color:#f97316\">⬡ Firewall</span>\n        </div>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>ICE:</strong> Fixed patrol path; stepping on or sharing a cell costs integrity</li>\n          <li><strong>Locked:</strong> Permanently blocked — forces detours</li>\n          <li><strong>Firewall:</strong> Passable but costs two steps — use only when it truly saves time or avoids ICE</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>⚡ Score & Pressure</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Safe moves build a <strong>combo chain</strong>; breaking it slows score growth</li>\n          <li>Remaining time and move efficiency decide grade S/A/B/C/D</li>\n          <li>Difficulty changes ICE speed and time multipliers together</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>🏁 Difficulty</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>Novice:</strong> Slower ICE, wider timer — learn patrols and combo</li>\n          <li><strong>Specialist:</strong> Standard crossings — predict ICE two steps ahead</li>\n          <li><strong>Ghost Protocol:</strong> Faster ICE, tighter time — shortcuts punish integrity hard</li>\n        </ul>",
