      "helpHtml": "<h3>🎯 Match Objective</h3>\n        <p>This is not just bigger-number card play. <strong>012 three-lane matrix combat</strong> is about turning a short deploy window into lane control, forcing the AI into weak trades, and draining its HP before your own structure collapses.</p>\n        <h3>🕹️ Round Flow</h3>\n        <ol>\n                  <li><strong>Read your hand:</strong> Identify resonance cards, backup lines, and potential Full Meal setups</li>\n                  <li><strong>Lock a lane:</strong> You can select a lane first or a card first, but the key is staying decisive under time pressure</li>\n                  <li><strong>Rebuild on the fly:</strong> Deployed cards can be recalled, so smart correction is part of the skill ceiling</li>\n                  <li><strong>Confirm with intent:</strong> Once you commit, the lane trade is live, so hesitation is already a loss</li>\n                  <li><strong>Use Full Meal with purpose:</strong> It is a pressure tool, not a button to mash every round</li>\n        </ol>\n        <h3>⚔️ Win-Rate Logic</h3>\n        <ul>\n                  <li><strong>Lane Resonance:</strong> Matching card value to lane number grants +45% power and is your most reliable edge</li>\n                  <li><strong>Full Meal:</strong> Covering lanes 0, 1, and 2 in one round boosts damage ×1.8 and can swing tempo hard</li>\n                  <li><strong>S / A / B tiers:</strong> These are not just numbers; they decide whether you can concentrate power where the AI is weakest</li>\n                  <li><strong>Win COMBO:</strong> Repeated multi-lane wins build snowball pressure and better scoring efficiency</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>⏱️ Time Pressure</h3>\n        <ul>\n                  <li><strong>Easy:</strong> Enough time to learn resonance, recall, and safe deployment order</li>\n                  <li><strong>Normal:</strong> The AI begins to fight for key resonance lanes with more discipline</li>\n                  <li><strong>Hard:</strong> Slow thinking gets punished, especially when Full Meal patterns appear</li>\n                  <li><strong>Extreme:</strong> Every hesitation turns into HP loss; reading and commitment must be immediate</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3>🏆 Grade Read</h3>\n        <ul>\n                  <li><strong>S:</strong> Fast decisions, stable pressure, and strong conversion in critical rounds</li>\n                  <li><strong>A:</strong> Repeatedly controls more lanes than the AI across the whole match</li>\n                  <li><strong>B:</strong> Wins through narrow survivals or late-round bursts</li>\n        </ul>",
